# Design system

Use only tokens from [docs/design-system.md](docs/design-system.md) (Aurora v4). Full pack: `docs/DESIGN SYSTEM COMPLETE_V3/design-system-v4-aurora.md`. Map tokens in `src/app/globals.css` `@theme`.

- Canvas: `slate-50`. Surfaces: `white` with resting `shadow-sm`. Default borders when needed: `slate-200`.
- One interactive accent: `indigo-600` for primary buttons, links, active nav, focus rings, and checked states.
- Secondary accents (`violet` / `rose` / `teal` / `amber`) are decorative only — avatars and category tags, never buttons.
- Buttons, search fields, tags, avatars, and pagination use `radius-full` (pills). Form fields in drawers use `radius-md` (12px). Cards use `radius-xl` / `radius-lg`.
- Status tags are dot-prefixed pills (tinted bg + colored dot), not left-bar credential tags.
- Cards float at rest with soft shadow; no hard border by default.
- Single typeface: Inter (400/500/600/700). No serif display pairing.
- Body text: `slate-600`. Headings: `slate-900`. Muted: `slate-400`.
- Do not mix Ministerial (ink/stone/bronze/moss sharp) patterns with Aurora. Prefer `indigo`/`slate` class names; legacy `ink`/`stone` aliases exist only for gradual migration.
